network-audio-controller (0.3.0~dev.1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  [packaging]
  * Correct Section in control file

  [netaudio]
  * Auto-resubscribe (known) receivers when transmitters change names.
  * Filter devices' transmitter channels to return actual channels.
  * Fix transmitter subscriptions not being updated correctly when receiver information was re-requested.
  * Rudimentary events system for use by client software.
  * Start listening to Dante's change notifications from the network
  * Add ability to request and set device Latency
  * Add ability to set device PCM Encoding and Sample Rate
  * Rename "Volume" service to "Metering"

